Name:         branch-and-recover
Version:      0.1.0
Description:  Branch on a decision, re-join after the branch that ran, and recover when deploy fails.
Created:      2026-01-02T03:04:05Z

INPUT             TYPE     DEFAULT  REQUIRED
fail_deploy       boolean  false    -
fail_rollback     boolean  false    -
rollback_seconds  number   0        -
route             string   canary   -
smoke_seconds     number   10       -

TASK      USES   NEEDS         TIMEOUT
decide    shell  -             300s
canary    shell  decide        300s
full      shell  decide        300s
verify    shell  canary,full   300s
deploy    shell  verify        300s
smoke     shell  verify        300s
announce  shell  deploy        300s
rollback  shell  deploy        300s
escalate  shell  rollback      300s
notify    shell  deploy,smoke  300s

JOIN      POLICY       NEEDS
verify    none_failed  canary,full
rollback  any_failed   deploy
escalate  any_failed   rollback
notify    all_done     deploy,smoke
